WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.845
&gt;&gt; We don't always have
enough time

00:00:01.845 --> 00:00:04.404
to cover all of the recent news,
so here with a recap

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:05.772
is one of our writers, Amber
Ruffin,

00:00:05.772 --> 00:00:08.674
in a segment we call
"Amber Says What."

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:10.142
[ Theme music plays ]

00:00:10.142 --> 00:00:13.579
-You guys,
things have been crazy.

00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:15.114
Okay, so, first of all,

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:17.917
a South Carolina man
won the lottery.

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:21.420
And then, 11 days later,
he won it again!

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.888
And I was like, "What?!"

00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:26.026
Then, at the same exact time,
in Alaska,

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:28.395
three different volcanoes
were erupting!

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:31.331
And I was like,
"What? What? What?"

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:36.002
Then, Lizzo and Cardi B released
their new hit video,

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.671
called "Rumors,"
where they're goddesses!

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:40.306
And I was like, "What?!"

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:43.009
Look at how cute they are!
Oh, my gosh.

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:45.778
I'm going to listen to that song
every single day!

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:48.481
I'm listening to it right now!

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:52.285
Their song is about the
importance of spreading rumors.

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:54.454
-I think it's about
the opposite of that.

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:56.122
-Oh, really?

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.690
That's not what I heard.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:01.127
I heard, Seth got Botox.
[ Gasps ]

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:03.463
Then, I heard --
and this one is true --

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:06.131
that a literal hermit
who lives in a cave

00:01:06.131 --> 00:01:08.968
got a coronavirus vaccine.
And I was like, "What?!"

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:13.573
A Serbian man emerged
from his cave where he lived

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:14.941
and found out
there was a pandemic,

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:16.642
and immediately got the shot.

00:01:16.642 --> 00:01:20.646
So, what is my nephew's excuse,
the little idiot?

00:01:20.646 --> 00:01:24.183
The hermit also was like,
"Where can I download 'Rumors'?"

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:27.153
And I was like,
"I got you, Caveman."

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:29.055
He caught it.

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:33.092
Then, Barack Obama turned 60
and had a birthday party!

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:34.460
I was like, "What, what?"

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:37.897
The guest list was
a who's who of celebrities --

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:41.533
Beyoncé, H.E.R., Erykah Badu,

00:01:41.533 --> 00:01:42.935
Amber Mildred Ruffin,

00:01:42.935 --> 00:01:44.603
John Legend, Chrissy --

00:01:44.603 --> 00:01:47.473
-Amber, you were not invited
to Barack's party.

00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:50.510
-Oh, really?
That's not what I heard.

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:52.078
[ Gasps ]
-You were not!

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:55.348
-Shut up! Neither were you!
-Shut up!

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:58.584
-Then, Rand Paul got suspended
from YouTube,

00:01:58.584 --> 00:02:01.487
and I was like, "What?!
You can get suspended

00:02:01.487 --> 00:02:04.223
from YouTube?!
Uh, uh, uh, how?"

00:02:04.223 --> 00:02:06.526
You know what's on YouTube?
This.

00:02:08.093 --> 00:02:10.196
-Oh!

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:12.865
-But Rand Paul got suspended?!

00:02:12.865 --> 00:02:15.134
What could he
have possibly done?

00:02:15.134 --> 00:02:16.836
Did he show his butt?

00:02:16.836 --> 00:02:20.740
I heard he showed his butt.
[ Gasps ]

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.675
Meanwhile, everybody
is talking about

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:24.911
the new Aretha Franklin movie,
called "Respect,"

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:26.579
where Jennifer Hudson
plays Aretha,

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:29.114
and it is so good.
It has me like...

00:02:29.114 --> 00:02:35.588
♪ You make me feel
like a natural what, what ♪

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:38.257
Now, I heard
the movie was so good

00:02:38.257 --> 00:02:40.093
that it is getting
its own sitcom.

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:42.528
-That's not true.
-It is true.

00:02:42.528 --> 00:02:44.997
And I get to play
the quirky next-door neighbor.

00:02:44.997 --> 00:02:49.502
Aretha, I can hear your music
all the way next door.

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:51.271
And I love it!

00:02:51.271 --> 00:02:52.805
[ "Seinfeld" theme music plays ]

00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:54.207
[ Snickers ]

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:57.910
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.910 --> 00:03:01.447
Then, I found -- I forgot
we were gonna do this.

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:03.883
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:06.252
-It's coming across.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.855
-Then, I found out
that pizza was delivered

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:12.091
to astronauts in space,
and I was like, "What?!

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:14.460
You found someone
who delivers to space?

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:17.630
I can't even get pizza
delivered here on planet Earth."

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.299
They sent them a giant package
filled with ingredients,

00:03:20.299 --> 00:03:23.136
and the astronauts
made their own pizzas.

00:03:23.136 --> 00:03:25.771
And I was like, "What?
These astronauts have to

00:03:25.771 --> 00:03:29.608
discover the final frontier
and make their own pizza?

00:03:29.608 --> 00:03:31.944
They don't do enough for you?"
Someone heard about them

00:03:31.944 --> 00:03:33.513
and was like,
"Oh, they have time.

00:03:33.513 --> 00:03:35.948
They'll be able
to make their own pizzas

00:03:35.948 --> 00:03:38.718
while keeping themselves alive
in space."

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:42.188
Then, I saw Rudy Giuliani
joined Cameo,

00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:44.523
that website where you
pay celebrities to make videos.

00:03:44.523 --> 00:03:47.559
And I was like, "What...
else do you expect him to do?

00:03:47.559 --> 00:03:49.328
Shoot, it's not like
he can practice law.

00:03:49.328 --> 00:03:50.596
He's a ghost!"

00:03:50.596 --> 00:03:54.634
And then, I saw
that his Cameos cost $375,

00:03:54.634 --> 00:03:57.337
and I was like, "What?"
Have you been on Cameo?

00:03:57.337 --> 00:04:00.706
You could get like 10 cast
members from "Basketball Wives"

00:04:00.706 --> 00:04:03.709
for that money.
This man is unemployed.

00:04:03.709 --> 00:04:06.446
You know what I heard?
I heard he's gonna star

00:04:06.446 --> 00:04:09.148
in a sitcom called
"Everybody Hates Rudy,"

00:04:09.148 --> 00:04:11.817
and I get to play the quirky
next-door neighbor.

00:04:11.817 --> 00:04:17.156
Hey, Rudy, I can hear your
Cameos all the way next door.

00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:18.825
And I love it!

00:04:18.825 --> 00:04:20.660
[ "Seinfeld" theme music plays ]

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:21.761
[ Laughter ]

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:22.996
-You were ready for that one.

00:04:22.996 --> 00:04:25.764
-Uhhh, [Laughs]
somehow less ready.

00:04:25.764 --> 00:04:29.302
Then, I heard "Jeopardy!"
hired two hosts,

00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:31.070
and I was like, "What, what?

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:34.907
Why would they hire LeVar Burton
and a second person?

00:04:34.907 --> 00:04:37.977
Then, I found out neither of
the two "Jeopardy!" hosts

00:04:37.977 --> 00:04:40.313
are LeVar Burton,
and I was like, "What?!

00:04:40.313 --> 00:04:42.915
Does this mean LeVar Burton
has some free time?"

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:46.084
I heard that he's gonna do
a variety show

00:04:46.084 --> 00:04:48.121
called "LeVar-iety Hour,"

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:50.189
where he dances, sings,
and reads books.

00:04:50.189 --> 00:04:53.860
And also, he's gonna have,
like, a sitcom

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:57.630
where he has a quirky
next-door neighbor,

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.032
and I get to play
that next-door neighbor.

00:05:00.032 --> 00:05:04.637
And so I'll be like,
"LeVar, I can hear you

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:07.306
reading those books
all the way next door.

00:05:07.306 --> 00:05:08.975
And I love it!"

00:05:08.975 --> 00:05:10.343
[ "Seinfeld" theme music plays ]

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:12.477
[ Laughter ]

00:05:12.477 --> 00:05:15.581
Also I can't stress this enough.
I heard Seth got Botox.

00:05:15.581 --> 00:05:16.949
-I didn't!
It just looks like I did!

00:05:16.949 --> 00:05:19.017
-This has been
"Amber Says What."

00:05:19.017 --> 00:05:20.386
[ Theme music plays ]

